    "kx.countdown.accessibility.remaining %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver only, never shown on screen, so there is no length limit. Label of the countdown to the end of a deal. %@ is the remaining time as a list of the days, hours and minutes parts joined in the list format of your language (keys \"kx.countdown.accessibility.days/hours/minutes\"), for example \"Endet in 2 Tagen, 3 Stunden und 4 Minuten\". Phrase it so those parts fit grammatically; %@ may move to any position.",
