    "kx.keycard.copy.hint" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver only, never shown on screen, so there is no length limit. Hint of the copy button on the licence card: the key is copied and deleted from the clipboard automatically after two minutes (the app sets this expiry). Keep \"two minutes\" exact.",
